{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:272650ba424179d7145b3dadee2a454d33286000660ba93c38dc8199803e8b35",
      "text": "三人一起，嘿——嘿——哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63eb5998ed581a0d49c49b928977c9eb3337c573437f6bb2cb0faf4b98178659",
      "text": "为了备战JIF而研究竞争对手的\nBeit。三人来到唱片店，\n并在那里看到了“某个光景”。\n以此为契机，新的工作\n找上了Beit……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51d39c80da2f26abefd7427cb3be75f0a254e75e67fae69f1f2588cf2c58910a",
      "text": "第7话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:272650ba424179d7145b3dadee2a454d33286000660ba93c38dc8199803e8b35",
      "text": "三人一起，嘿——嘿——哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:465d4e959010d1f4e96266fdd167652ead5eacef463cdeafdbcbcbb9dd26f1cb",
      "text": "实，●●●●プロデューサー。\n你们在做什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3b81d59ad01790178be2ffb73b82ee2c6f7af52845d641ca12773db0e6119f7",
      "text": "那是……偶像杂志？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1f31d3057c009e3b8d161606209667300aedc1f5401d68ec4d58e2e41f3fc0a",
      "text": "嗯。为了JIF，\n我们在调查各种各样的竞争对手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4adc52055e53cb56ccf979f4b05d60115238555df4cfa480ea03177c0f5bdee",
      "text": "比如最近这个偶像组合势头很猛……\n这组是男女混合，曲风非常广……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c5e71cdc770a4c89901b5565049535bf55c22b50d7864bcff095c4488f33d97",
      "text": "嗯？实说的话好难懂……\n恭二，你明白吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e66e8599d46a117635bf0621c8cadde3525f9e254e72279661f18c20733bf2",
      "text": "不，我也没太听明白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed159778d2fc5cac957a8d7e5df0798f7534b5b5707a74ceaf792dc2c65cb101",
      "text": "既然如此，大家要不要一起去唱片店\n看看呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5aa79d48ff55cb3578e85346f7fbdb42f282e709e07ec379bc9d20b8091d5c",
      "text": "挺好的。\n实际去看看听听才是最容易弄懂的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87e0f49fd92c4e6b7bde31b87918de1e58930c1c97bbeaf2822b915a051c9ef",
      "text": "我还是第一次去唱片店！\n我想去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ebc98f166b3e88bf821c60a8d276349d77a56d4dcf28a414ebd0d6e7563db6",
      "text": "那我们大家一起去看看吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6286d6db588a690a68761914f22b7c6a9abe2f1fe17dde5f8a8b6abdf4a1c4f9",
      "text": "好的。我马上准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aac503eb03fe05bdd73623ef1f5c7785fe2cd542704d71f8087791dc7fdea59",
      "text": "唱片店",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:607322bbc0188bc2268d1f7898134360d1df0aa31d55aef141593a6c51bd21fa",
      "text": "哇啊，这里就是唱片店！\n这是吉祥物的毛绒玩具吗？好可爱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de9e520fe84e8c5f2a5c58937640faf0cb38f187df4e36e5bb9a867609d3d96",
      "text": "货架整理得一目了然，\n宣传板的设计也很讲究啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d381bec65e7f51bf0575fb78a2dd1a644c33ff2a074fa080e00c01444f3f8d5d",
      "text": "宣传板的内容也很棒哦。\n你看，像这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6dc844ad437d3ec0d2ab782bc2fcf0cb340bd7a32768eb0558a25e40827f125",
      "text": "这位偶像的世界观非常积极明快。\n文案和设计都很好地体现了这一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d839506df51783106681d81671f7f59da6c957809bab096a4f4c032b00c5d0dd",
      "text": "刚好也有试听用的CD呢。\n皮埃尔，有兴趣的话听听看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40b28768ad773575bfe21484329c0e62d9860f5f44449e2af5f9bd84d7a9bead",
      "text": "哇……这首歌，超级闪闪发亮！\n恭二也来听听看这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d87bba868a946f08f9a4725ad36618785add0c18212b1e0dffa45aa4bb4110b",
      "text": "其他受瞩目的偶像是……嗯？\n那个板子是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aadd7541c9a984c560c93f325790a60a174c51ea91f74830508dd1702a275805",
      "text": "“店员推荐的新人偶像”？\n……咦，有我们Beit的名字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2851dcb5eba57e21f89bf9c6b6dae5f85964ddc5159a58c346dc90e3c2d00d36",
      "text": "好厉害！\n上面写了我们的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d158fff4ded58c3bc80837fc973a48da587def9d3b424899f70c69f748d125",
      "text": "是前几天引起话题的视频啊。\n排版得很漂亮呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_b:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86c0678622d6a401f751be466a61471ad57af5d4395421714aa50582e6b834c",
      "text": "居然有人对还是新人的我们这么关注。\n真让人高兴啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c1b48a624ea27fd438e855c4d54ce2ef875e5564f54ca29e0b8b4ee57b8504",
      "text": "那个，打扰一下。\n请问各位该不会是Beit吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b886ddefa8c415277e8a39ffc2c3ecba1da4e72b474b931da3d796f3372d7498",
      "text": "咦？是的，确实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eb00721621de2744b6a0d029d18ac004ead6eead9cf0e1e33529d14ff5975ac",
      "text": "果然是！负责做这个展示区的人就是我！\n我从出道起就是Beit的粉丝了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a44dd5c83a6f452a8c4bbc5e364fdd2b832b89ae0d3c32ab2b6b2bd778da5689",
      "text": "哇，真的吗！？能见到你我也好高兴！\n……等等，恭二，你怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f51878322cb8b9b9bdbe0c03f097aa1da233bf0e228ae58c9b5810d32c4db3",
      "text": "啊，没……\n我只是在想，原来我们真的有粉丝在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac3c810dc5594c8779b1be78115f81060841cdc11441a0ba4372ef6d0cef6fc",
      "text": "像这样当面见到还是第一次……\n虽然现在才说有点迟，但感觉终于有了真实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c5e5c128fbc703726d8dfa670aaa554490acc280cd819eedec05f484012f25d",
      "text": "啊哈哈。作为偶像的真实感？\n嘛，我也能理解那种心情啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50759f82794086148d6cf0a7633a81ebeae690c9a43a2f4cf9162cd44361e954",
      "text": "毕竟比起当偶像的时间，\n我当偶像粉丝的时间要长得多嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adce473792d98e299c10325db20291c14f2e3fb0f220dd35e10311da03fc664e",
      "text": "那个，如果不介意的话，\n能让我们拍一下这里的展示专区吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36a63ad3672ffa7433b237f2e5eece145e4b9c14c41f1224a06fba4f167246e",
      "text": "好的，当然没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:070dfffe7852ec68efabeebd49a011be0df5e215c7b7d368319255f118818c74",
      "text": "难得来一次，能在展板的某个地方\n签个名吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5fcefe8ddd4609a8448d1fd895a77bd6555b5031098428b2240c8f1619ff758",
      "text": "我也想和展板合影！\n排在一起拍，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:087acbf071c1626a91d6921aba4ac6494eea2a0fc45b18d445f14bbaaf0cca5b",
      "text": "好、好的！\n求之不得！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d3d88ce459f2f0d78646948a600ab165b8ab4029af4c8d43e1756821a9d460b",
      "text": "真的非常感谢！\n签名我们也会好好陈列出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5500168a57c5b4db5bc9cec0d2315286e75399e21870c2fbfac6ce88a181cc52",
      "text": "我也谢谢你——！\n拍照真开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11d9476a3b8789f0779c1b8cb24797b5970a53894f0452fc448a0210a932398",
      "text": "店员，不好意思。关于把拍下的照片\n发到事务所博客上的事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35c30ea49ab348224ded867a12a725c6462a479a72c90bf9460f2639f3bba0b8",
      "text": "我询问了负责人，\n对方表示完全没有问题，请务必发布！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157fc61a0e033bb31407c2720d9b6d70dcc9dafb5b0dd53daaa48e3f6ae3c446",
      "text": "太好啦。这样就能让更多人\n看到这么棒的展示了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000183:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:870a32d0e76375b48d6f7aa708eb0950ab5c5eda3e368760b66143959506f234",
      "text": "喂。是我，神乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0b23f31e5a4a632b8fa9c239b39f93f3abfb750b88871e3b544d5e0b618f08e",
      "text": "今天去了唱片店，\n在那里看到了Beit的专区。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c443da422cf596f83b5b2c7516f906cbb62a99730db661404c5edff925fb4ab6",
      "text": "前些天博客上刊登的照片，\n原来就是那家店啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dabc5405de7f727dc85ef549cb00fc372ed6370ff26436d6978020bb00a468fe",
      "text": "装饰得很漂亮，也很引人瞩目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000199:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc10639bbc31ed3437a8baf9d561bd7f94335b825c507db0f14d2e8142519478",
      "text": "真是令人感激的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e3fbcb2ee2ff029c183631a93b75c142d41becafa15d3cb0a69ecdca88bd83",
      "text": "是啊。我们倾注心意的音乐，\n切实传达到了人们心中……真令人欣慰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000203:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8269571819081873f05ec71b15b695174b42a54e9d4e6f01df1193978a5b015",
      "text": "我也必须努力，\n不输给Beit的各位才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000205:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3598dd219cd522eb49a19f1b08860fdb0ecfd965aedda887f835b1213d7a8cba",
      "text": "一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38c922d3f3eab764826ef89891fe0df315427db4ab5b69037d3a8dd04a089112",
      "text": "嗯。\n首先就从明天的练习开始全力以赴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_c:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6ac512e267856fc7344e9f7988ae105d5edf04df3c88c64e832aca30e7f9661",
      "text": "突然打电话给你，不好意思。\n那么，明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6273539fbb7cd626fe91279df42df2c60bc5b752abe2de9717ed732a9e0fae",
      "text": "那时候那家唱片店发来的工作委托？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebc60e507532a17bd42a04126470012ab9d14e4cdfa1eeb7e17a7d8327717c31",
      "text": "是的！店员似乎对各位当时的应对\n非常感动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f9ecab9d42eb95fcf58424f3a269650daedf3e80a45408ea083b64dc6e7158",
      "text": "特意去向上司争取，\n为各位争取到了这份工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5bef3e5bd10c20f09ae1a542a6258be722555cc7d8bfa1129f0ffd0b5e04173",
      "text": "哦——！那么，\n又能让当时的店员露出笑容了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340215b742c2f6614af582a492cabc9e1e1a0a16b58acba1ad0ff9bb83b725f7",
      "text": "呵呵，只要我们努力，肯定可以的。\n那么，工作的内容是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8260ca98c41c3a58207f7bfe7aac00e84f8025e30a98c6b9dbaded6018f82ba4",
      "text": "是的。对方希望各位担任一日店长，\n并负责店内广播。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106a3d1d11118a47ee93521f38286e30492be010e50d85f5ef44e60e68f59ef4",
      "text": "店内、广播……？\n恭二你们以前做过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9082287bf33b6ee1fe089405bec7719362dea633d9fd3bfe98229ac0ba346059",
      "text": "不……我顶多只在便利店里\n做过店内招揽客人的吆喝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80225c9d849950858b5d05f18f5ae1999585721244a2f2e0b6f08c3167a9f57c",
      "text": "我也差不多吧。\n顶多也就是录过花店电话留言用的提示音而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0aac89af9fcf69d71319677fe5e3bc87b4a14271c92dbc2bb2ed1e5c390ceed",
      "text": "嗯……我也不太懂。\n但是，我想做店内广播的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:763046c3d99c3f7cd993b6e7c51feb991631605846a33375262d8ac2920d12c3",
      "text": "辛苦啦～！\n咦？恭二君你们怎么看起来没什么精神？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e8bcfcba87747a393b2833ca7088f6781a59ad1eab61b9c1a679746959e4f1",
      "text": "啊，其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13b44a5c77f41db1d912a496ed219f437d1858cd360e9b5038b297b6e811a3d",
      "text": "店内广播？\n什么嘛，就这点事啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:624ba1171cf71c87e58af6cd7fa8fe74ae041ccbaf030005ec0e397e0bdb58bb",
      "text": "既然这样，那就由我们来教你们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16b09beac21ed6d2e3ad5d9ff0974ff5edb9dd1af0b1733941489d242b3541b8",
      "text": "因为我当过声优，\n如果是简单的事情应该能教教你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b9d6fc016fcb8e295d02022a5db08f638a9201719af261341f2772a8b474ae0",
      "text": "もふもふえん要教我们吗？太棒了！\n这样的话，工作一定会大成功的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39c02fcd3c339525213f576ecb369409c3573d0ee635ea0d3c373e9ee78fa7e9",
      "text": "是啊。能有这么强力的帮手来真是帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d16e68003bba44383754bffc765113f2235e63a57cd3710fc129e1cb196ad02",
      "text": "诶、嘿嘿……\n为了能帮上忙，我会努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bea8f002fa58e21554f123d06d420bcc388a9a2f180c415be83e09181e4ce6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n我们的日程怎么样～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7154e10ee6124d54bcee59333b57700e11cb7a88c2c4fc554c38bd0d4d98e0a8",
      "text": "もふもふえん的各位，\n在录音当天也是有空的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb4c9fa01d379151591fa4c33a6c18f2d2d40d95ad8f1024d3796a644bcafc9",
      "text": "太好啦！那当天就由我们来\n狠狠地特训你们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000173:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5e0a2602585aaedbb82c88e09911e0aee61a3d155c263d368380f4527cd9220",
      "text": "……喂。是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n是我，翼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000183:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c05e9c4605cd1a3400b1e83d959bf39d9f1924caddf4bc9c01ba8e865b23c04",
      "text": "突然打电话过来，不好意思。\n听说Beit的各位要担任一日店长……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17d4293814b0706b2717709bb9b3a7971a73df30ff1966dfd7c72ca941f7166",
      "text": "还要做店内广播对吧？\n呜呜，肯定会很紧张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000187:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c5e949b90f27f236d8c43370668aed8c75f3a90ad02d1caa7aa2419690f06ef",
      "text": "我当飞行员候补生的时候，\n也练习过广播呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5042e366cbf23a5646eb4433b287c67e50a1a52a49047ce84bfffa6ba60399c",
      "text": "当时都做过些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000191:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498d7e1cf0c3c07d8ca7e129cc365f332bf0e2123e5856cafa92ddcf648c5679",
      "text": "让我想想，比如说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334a7b4305e40b8f8752ad8fd3c88138e890c82a4a4e1b947e7ab3b4997783c5",
      "text": "会根据目的地不同，\n对广播的内容做一些调整。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a79fd1297773dcea0c01cb876859403e12a9657deedb3b26fb5fcbde878e985",
      "text": "听说聊一聊当地的特产或观光景点，\n乘客们也会很高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322c66231c7107e2f2c3d376f33abc79cf5ad50075066a2f73d9698ad44f722c",
      "text": "所以练习的时候\n也会特别注意这些方面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000199:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68792294133bc3db0a08b98d47bad38db9ede008c8679371ba2db961f51ff992",
      "text": "Beit的店内广播\n会是什么样的内容，真令人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_e:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d81db960fcb3fb284b06170dcd61eb68b54d6d78a6900158820e93e4730706d",
      "text": "我也会去听的。\n那么先挂了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录音当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01451276a37323c4b971f581ae599686dfc91f68a8564c32d572fe4b55a36b26",
      "text": "大家好。我是315 Production旗下的\nもふもふえん成员，冈村直央。今天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f3cf5258757af6cf0bb94badbc9fe48c5c3229f899b48fd71e9eea84545c854",
      "text": "大、大概就是这种感觉。\n恭二君，请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86170a4d596f6ee48aff5f7f0c44009df9774713681a442755b2f34968d49571",
      "text": "啊、啊啊。……大家好。\n我是315 Production旗下，Beit的鹰、鹰城……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214b6bbfc3b72a50359656c653eff9515059a9bcf6d97dcd237de3bb6b8c6b44",
      "text": "抱、抱歉。……还真是不太顺利啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:289e9d2bdae63024149dc53c219c050656a336c2d230fb58dc3b957bdcf16a40",
      "text": "（我本来就不太擅长讲话……\n也称不上待人热情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:173ae027422020b16f023c6a355d89ac1eee811df8668681adfcfc279f40e9a3",
      "text": "（店内广播这种事，\n我根本就是完全不适合的类型吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40f787b52b924570988fd69fecf1ffafca348d2b428a717d4083c18f1b9d178",
      "text": "恭二先生。只要放松下来，\n一定会讲得更好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:255a31b77d4e5f9f67e5d0858e3522fe3fabd2de37fe38f6885967e23c5c7ca6",
      "text": "就是说呀～。\n一开始就没有人能拿到满分大红花嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7fec77245196a58b0f80870d5d4d2bc5c08af3db4cea4c28a60312c7a5acec5",
      "text": "……也是，我可能有点妄自菲薄了。\n谢谢你们两个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000128:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78",
      "text": "休息中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b27163d5e3c58066c5acbe66abd161428f3ac8fa476f5a5deea6e047d2b389c",
      "text": "恭二！休息的时候打扰你，不好意思。\n这个怎么读？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f5475a70107ebf92f239929a0b035173da48d14d09b694c80bffec0e1234d1",
      "text": "嗯……？\n这个读作“好评（こうひょう）”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d911a034d102edc8d40ad1ad41e0e77f256446ee6b88cb8b741e2d309f741c8f",
      "text": "这个呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01f1c3e9e6fd28a8e29c4aee35a68c8f0c4a1c1e82b559e67b881dff179d1e37",
      "text": "“就任（しゅうにん）”。\n台词本借我一下，我写在旁边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88772dceab669b4033bc7cab691d155fc7af95be03f26ea746b08d51c880cdd",
      "text": "谢谢！录音一定要一起加油到最后哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88c4adfac194ff112e9735c522e52546079483f7cb32575ac01956eb05c1605b",
      "text": "（皮埃尔在不习惯的环境里也这么努力。\n我也不能再磨磨唧唧的了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000200:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ac67f2699fa5007c1cd43f2836616ce8c1bab311c6f06592cc7c0539a453836",
      "text": "好的，这是最后一句台词了吧。\n拜托了。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000213:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a22572f8cb1227bbe48545d5a19a63357360c626ee6de7deb483174c2b88622",
      "text": "光临本店的各位顾客。今后也请\n多多支持315 Production。以上是Beit的鹰城恭二。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000230:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ce4e204f8c8d75a540879cd3745a426bbb0cb8aaabbdccf5aa4d80046c8223",
      "text": "录音真好玩<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000232:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f785dd6769053bbdc251ced02c3552ef7181203635acb5d145184f9b4ae46fde",
      "text": "起初还担心会变成什么样，\n不过是个不错的经历",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000234:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43e275aa7a66c0d8d59b26a06de46b9b5c0022e4afbc0fce19a1676698b8d915",
      "text": "最后顺利讲好了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000237:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cefc37c1e174eac001a4e40560d9785537647260bceae37db24616984c40f16",
      "text": "嗯\n多亏了もふもふえん啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000239:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:510aaa4beae7a1e758991521957a214dc7a689297fa177e8fd05aef53dbb02f8",
      "text": "もふもふえん的大家\n好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000243:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a1130f1aac0164bd0237694209bad21630ff852cd97e85d70365e03e21c554",
      "text": "明明年纪比我们小却那么可靠，\n值得学习的地方真多呢\n我们可得好好看齐才行<emoji>image_talk_emoji_23</emoji><emoji>image_talk_emoji_08</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000245:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2466043b62bdbce31cfff2a8865a9efd0e24e333845cd844236f0b6706f8c41d",
      "text": "下次就是一日店长了吗\n无论是接待客人，还是听自己的广播，\n都有点让人紧张啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000247:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfe01b60112d4e96dc2faba900d0844cc77877f1b4b2922de3cfe761a6729dba",
      "text": "到当天之前，\n必须得再好好学学才行",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_f:cmd-000249:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ff8b4e236deb6bcc23a5a59075265ab6c14419a7ba9795390a39c7f56664e4",
      "text": "为了能让客人们和我们的粉丝开心，\n大家一起加油吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji><emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74dac6c059d81fe9933ec830b1c3ea4ae7555a76379acf7cf3d5582a2610fa38",
      "text": "终于到了一日店长的日子了呢。\n招待客人这种事实在好久没做过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c822c627ecdc05a74ff29e9427f8fe0d32794ced98680e416f7862d13cff53f1",
      "text": "必须带着笑容努力才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195067e55da229d2a5c9028b8617f37e07e4c5d9d2ae68e953161ef27d0fcdd1",
      "text": "（笑容吗……打工的时候，\n客人经常说我脸上没有笑容来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:947077be6296d186c1a6924a194e79a8cda813f1c2184425992c0fb46e53f4a2",
      "text": "恭二，你在紧张吗？\n没关系的，有我们在呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d8f4954d51910ad0c851dce114c3c9b57c48b7d87bf2ed6c7d9d8dd1e2c23f3",
      "text": "不是一个人，大家一起加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c5f5d2b0bb6b1320c8f1a1b961fdf59bc4c82e8a426320db8d1b0ba56b87db8",
      "text": "皮埃尔……谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec0647008d7f2a54012db3684db182b934815af43d9a942e598c1f013f2f64fa",
      "text": "不用客气！\n这是你教我汉字的谢礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c2dcd67940542c5837d943c357bb2cff28645b462ea61b8e03db3881094d997",
      "text": "好——。趁现在，\n大家一起来重新鼓鼓劲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9e61640e6b01c416a2128f60157420bb40bc97eaf8f617c87c6abe3076cec2",
      "text": "鼓劲……要怎么做？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e1fd9fccc3909583dd198b35b1388fbf668a6fc5e89419bf06d597ccc2af4b",
      "text": "比如把手叠在一起，或者围成一圈……\n对了！喊“嘿——嘿——，哦——！”怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c6d508cf9f2384b320972a47d1d24be9af582d27b04e2db92f89a3b76b4deba",
      "text": "嘿——嘿——，哦——！嘿——嘿——，哦——！……\n呵呵。感觉是很有意思的话呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7424d238ba5e270ab0246dc6726bd00787ce3dec83cd1917e0dc77462b6bbc78",
      "text": "对吧？\n皮埃尔，能由你来领口号吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80bcd3d9bc243de8abeecb8bc7e4e740f58a021f5825b4d6a8dd664a0a2b5e2f",
      "text": "明白了！\nBeit！嘿——嘿——，哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_g:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729b0fc41d3c59770a71fb44484496e452cf683357b13058565d1b06506bedcc",
      "text": "不好意思。\n请问这位偶像的CD摆在哪里呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d76dc95dae108852c6e3115bd2ff1db1c87e33c7d2b7f92585b8bbb5f86a24a4",
      "text": "卖场在这一边。\n我来带您过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d609c298f36263e1bc843b561678eb113aa784de72d90101248ce121308279b",
      "text": "那位偶像很棒呢。\n我也去过演唱会，现场超级棒的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a23fbd9997ccd5f71a1602cda7b26ace1b9dcd1fd42cbc68a9663061d7a1ca",
      "text": "……嗯。这里的货架空了啊。\n去仓库补点货过来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2ce76573ebe02fbca172e2f1ffb56cfb89738568713602cd6286d9e701a0af",
      "text": "呃，名字是“A”开头的。\n所以是在这个展区吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f436a5cedc7e5dc929df9b1cda2e53fcc9f5314315ec6363a835379b0e01f47",
      "text": "……啊，找到了！\n客人，请走这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b429202103fb29e7fa355b4287358f34c6c60203e260cab3880575e6dc2ade61",
      "text": "总觉得他们虽然是艺人，\n却一点架子都没有……很有亲近感呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0abd5d8b13643ad16569eecfe9da001612e3c39cea5dddf1c18f71af02e98c17",
      "text": "那个！我以前虽然不知道Beit，\n但买了各位的CD！今后会为你们应援的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:932c29c60a2f8154279586f22c576781f90f55fe2d7cd365f4af2843c6324a7d",
      "text": "非常感谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b6fefe15183e5b56c2b045e9da712e5c1d2855836e1e770b5cdb65b66fcd39",
      "text": "实、恭二！有各种各样的人\n认识我们了……！好开心啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_h:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3edd8b50eb75b55f4e2e82b9f015fdc2d65eed3572ff6a9fa0dd0330ab2d3883",
      "text": "呵呵，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:146c5bec34d5e7758cc88fc1cd0a4c522254c57184f739f36e006c4deaee18c4",
      "text": "闭店后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd290a90c57653beba1efc1a0c1acb92d6d8a195132afb892b570976239b4987",
      "text": "今天真是太感谢了！\n活动大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f89945faf134b88f42dda80ee4b55bf73fd7ef06ad76c2fc60e27171769659",
      "text": "……我们这边才是，今天获得了很棒的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b55317f5e838dd2fdfb1ded3992bd4339e4e0fd975c64fe0f7f148365310d8",
      "text": "为了不辜负大家的期待，我们会更加努力。\n所以……今后也请多多支持我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71121103c432c267f823ff67d75c9f1185775691108669e1c31bec21dbccadc",
      "text": "当天的回家路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac54338bc022cee712de31c64ada3d036c75ef2f66eba3a16561e8eec3418d4b",
      "text": "不仅让很多人认识了我们，\n还把笑容带给了每一位前来的客人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e52a92b0092abed44371beecd0b8fd914adb92f04b804b39111a652928bee10",
      "text": "总觉得又让世界多了一份和平呢。\n大家的努力没有白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4843ab51a07c0f8b5f7d7b27180c19bc6422453f2e511c991f8680daec98af35",
      "text": "是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77f2aa6743b2d74761dfe9001abce0fc01d53b674ef3f4de7e25b20708269a5d",
      "text": "（虽然可能只是迈出了一小步。但是……\n现在的我，正在用自己的力量开辟道路）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f014c07d418333d1b609b656cb4cb22845aa9b5129390299bab5df4d331565",
      "text": "（就这样作为偶像继续成长下去……\n由我们三个人，去抓住梦想！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8433a32a17a14313b5f8d99a1168e8c0bca4f180a0c73d17484ea31317d17c96",
      "text": "皮埃尔先生从刚才开始就一直很安静，\n没事……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b7e46f387d09d9688c3c64ac93a534d82a272876bda7a995563c1b9f56bb59",
      "text": "嗯……唔唔……\n大家，笑容。好开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e11043db00e3b8a6cfa3f7aea89bec399803141388581290753e202a7e637a",
      "text": "……睡得真香啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9acbb2b1d4285ae8109e731884665c4edd37c4ced977fd1757eabfeddb4f7b",
      "text": "皮埃尔也很努力了嘛。\n就让他这么睡吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e7479eb058cf1e3e5ab05586dd6220e8d885d667717611e3b6e0954c993b58",
      "text": "请、请问……我是实先生的粉丝！\n今后也会一直支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7954b76c4b81338c2960c8cd609d2faccbe458f3ae394f27db8914f460252957",
      "text": "（叔叔、以及许许多多的人\n为之着迷的“偶像”……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_i:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1833584b52539da0264f42c773003580e15fdcadfdbd236f791333214ddd9745",
      "text": "（我自己，是否也稍微接近了一点\n那样的存在呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000008:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42820b35e844aafa393e8933de2f80ce4fce66732fac4f03a2b1e6f001301c97",
      "text": "……那么，今年的JIF出演偶像，\n就这么定下了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e2bb352c44dfc20e7e01c86dc64b587b4243d73c9ca2614aed3fa707f126089",
      "text": "等等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b80be034bb0c063359f24e5bb245bf6d76fa415efc26c7c67083e6263b09bc9",
      "text": "雷、雷皇先生？\n会议已经结束了。事到如今您还要……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a8e5fbd404ce257bcb0ce64489cca00c9bba4e43ac9a51d3776ec67c6b76e4",
      "text": "毫无新意的与会者阵容。\n一如往年被大事务所新人塞满的名单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913eff2fd90c5c783699e04d72b5ce25e50ac3e24b343a124c2c6d58e669caae",
      "text": "你们到底有没有认真考虑过\n偶像界的未来？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94a2dd6efc23c462f5bb0f3dd3fc959d395049789431fbcf381bcd304a32970",
      "text": "我已经说过很多次了，应该设置投票产生的出演名额。\n为了倾听偶像粉丝们真实的心声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:121027670d78f278407ac83d2f426528d79d04a2e7f949e4877b6a98b09922a4",
      "text": "又是这个啊……\n算了，既然您都说到这个份上了，那就依您吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25bf38f8a1adf9fde12f2dcc152429e6e7041e2e0476c9e9ece976fc76c81554",
      "text": "反正我觉得最后选出来的也还是老面孔就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41899aace6e8b722e7f44d76d24958c687110343f1de0fdc62133b1ce84342a0",
      "text": "不。……一定会有脱颖而出的事务所的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
